    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over Engineered is an idle strategy game that encourages construction of complex machines. Using limited space, money, and power; you must build complex contraptions to bring a ball from its spawn, to its goal. The longer each ball takes, the more money you make in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.poster.avif?t=1755194634\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.webm?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.mp4?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Parts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new machine parts to build more complex contraptions. Give each item a whirl and see what new creations you can bring into your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/f4fc93208135dbac3a4e9373d5fb4b53.avif?t=1755194634\" width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Balls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new balls with various properties that can shift the style of your gameplay. Each gives a new multiplier to help continue your need for complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Power:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate and disperse power to build more sophisticate contraptions. The more complex an item is, the more power an item will take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.poster.avif?t=1755194634\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.webm?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.mp4?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Efficiency:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over-Engineered was designed with the principle that time is a valuable resource; both in-game, and out of it. As a product, many multitasking modes were implemented to allow for maximum time efficiency. This includes the ability to adjust the screen size at will, as well as a fully docked version that keeps them in the game loop while simultaneously giving their screen back.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over Engineered is an idle strategy game that encourages construction of complex machines. Using limited space, money, and power; you must build complex contraptions to bring a ball from its spawn, to its goal. The longer each ball takes, the more money you make in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.poster.avif?t=1755194634\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.webm?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.mp4?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Parts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new machine parts to build more complex contraptions. Give each item a whirl and see what new creations you can bring into your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/f4fc93208135dbac3a4e9373d5fb4b53.avif?t=1755194634\" width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Balls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new balls with various properties that can shift the style of your gameplay. Each gives a new multiplier to help continue your need for complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Power:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate and disperse power to build more sophisticate contraptions. The more complex an item is, the more power an item will take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.poster.avif?t=1755194634\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.webm?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/209ea4c9fb2e458052112eeb6a7f1243.mp4?t=1755194634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Efficiency:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over-Engineered was designed with the principle that time is a valuable resource; both in-game, and out of it. As a product, many multitasking modes were implemented to allow for maximum time efficiency. This includes the ability to adjust the screen size at will, as well as a fully docked version that keeps them in the game loop while simultaneously giving their screen back.</p>",
